WEBVTT

00:01.870 --> 00:04.540
At the monster hunting expedition
squad's camping ground,

00:05.580 --> 00:09.920
the food that the knights made here
was too barbaric.

00:11.130 --> 00:14.340
Wait, will you put that huge meat
into the pot just like that?

00:14.340 --> 00:16.680
What? The soup seasoning is just salt?

00:16.680 --> 00:17.890
What about stock?!

00:17.890 --> 00:21.730
We're knights, see?
It's obvious we can't cook.

00:21.730 --> 00:24.650
Then what about adventurers,
like Miss Iris...?

00:25.730 --> 00:28.360
Her? No way.

00:28.360 --> 00:31.900
If we let her do it, she would only cook
a dangerous abomination!

00:31.900 --> 00:34.610
Even if I can't cook, I still can live.

00:34.610 --> 00:37.030
- That's right!
- As long as it's edible!

00:38.330 --> 00:40.660
All of them are so defiant about it.

00:42.200 --> 00:45.870
Despite how I am,
I pay attention to kids' food.

00:46.460 --> 00:49.960
I don't want them to eat
some sloppily made food!

00:51.550 --> 00:52.970
Big Brother?

00:52.970 --> 00:55.300
Just wait up, Alan, Elena.

00:55.930 --> 00:57.760
I will help you guys out!

00:57.760 --> 00:58.890
O-Okay...

01:01.570 --> 01:03.410
Use these for the veggies.

01:03.410 --> 01:05.390
Please cut that meat smaller!

01:05.400 --> 01:06.350
Take out the stalk!

01:06.350 --> 01:07.980
Here, use these as the broth!

01:07.980 --> 01:09.480
Discard the lye!

01:12.610 --> 01:14.440
Let's eat!

01:14.440 --> 01:16.150
- It's so good!
- It's so good!

01:16.740 --> 01:19.950
- Delicious! Takumi, you're great!
- So good, so good.

01:19.950 --> 01:21.660
(Smug)

01:22.700 --> 01:24.870
Well, thanks to that...

01:24.870 --> 01:27.290
The next morning,

01:27.290 --> 01:30.590
under the expectant looks of the others,

01:31.210 --> 01:33.510
I made breakfast as well.

01:34.830 --> 01:36.830
We're counting on you, Takumi!

01:36.830 --> 01:37.800
Yeah...

01:41.350 --> 01:43.060
I feel that gaze again.

01:45.390 --> 01:47.060
Come here, Alan, Elena.

01:56.740 --> 02:02.220
♪Leisurely, leisurely,
let's slowly familiarize ourselves♪

02:02.220 --> 02:07.730
(A Journey Through Another World:
Raising Kids While Adventuring)

02:08.370 --> 02:13.250
♪The adventure to a new world is beginning♪

02:13.500 --> 02:18.090
♪Into a journey where
we can find fun things♪

02:20.090 --> 02:24.970
♪There are many encounters,
it's so exciting♪

02:24.970 --> 02:31.150
♪If you're with your family,
the things you can do will multiply♪

02:31.150 --> 02:34.070
♪It's okay to worry,
but you must not be overprotective♪

02:34.070 --> 02:37.030
♪I want you to praise me when
I try something and succeed♪

02:37.030 --> 02:39.820
♪It will be a wonderful party
if we can do this and that♪

02:39.820 --> 02:44.700
♪Because we will be together forever♪

02:45.240 --> 02:48.500
♪Please pat my head♪

02:48.500 --> 02:51.000
♪With your hand that I truly love♪

02:51.000 --> 02:56.920
♪I will send you thank you from
the deepest part of my heart, okay?♪

02:56.920 --> 02:59.630
♪Please pat me more♪

02:59.630 --> 03:02.760
♪See me with those eyes
filled with kindness♪

03:02.760 --> 03:09.100
♪I want this smile to last,
forever and ever♪

03:09.100 --> 03:14.770
♪Leisurely, leisurely,
let's slowly walk on♪

03:15.270 --> 03:20.650
♪Leisurely, Yururing,
I am happy, Travel Days♪

03:23.540 --> 03:28.130
(Big Brother is Mad)

03:33.000 --> 03:35.380
I am now convinced
the forest is not as normal.

03:35.380 --> 03:40.090
Yeah. And the overall number
of monster encounters is low.

03:40.090 --> 03:43.050
Excuse me, what's wrong? Huh?

03:43.770 --> 03:47.440
I would like to say thanks
for saving us yesterday.

03:47.440 --> 03:48.680
Thank you.

03:48.690 --> 03:51.400
I'm the Third Captain, Farrius Tierra.

03:52.600 --> 03:54.690
You're already allowed to move?

03:55.270 --> 03:58.730
With what had happened,
I couldn't just sleep around.

03:59.940 --> 04:02.110
That was unusual too!

04:02.110 --> 04:06.030
Multiple monster groups usually don't
come in the shallow part of the forest.

04:06.720 --> 04:09.410
Yet on the contrary,
today we don't see a single one.

04:09.410 --> 04:15.050
Usually, their numbers rise
as we go deeper into the forest.

04:15.060 --> 04:17.460
The knight's discussion is concerning.

04:18.210 --> 04:22.880
But I keep getting distracted
by that occasional gaze.

04:25.810 --> 04:27.060
Anything wrong?

04:27.060 --> 04:28.930
That's why I realized it late.

04:34.970 --> 04:37.310
Late in noticing
a strong enemy has come.

04:37.310 --> 04:38.400
Above us!

04:45.260 --> 04:46.300
That's...

04:47.160 --> 04:48.700
Evil Viper!

04:51.680 --> 04:53.250
It's coming down! Retreat!

04:56.720 --> 04:57.640
Run!

05:10.390 --> 05:12.350
You two, don't! Get away from it!

05:13.640 --> 05:15.100
Wind Cutter!

05:16.270 --> 05:17.060
So fast!

05:17.560 --> 05:19.310
O' Earth, pierce it!

05:19.940 --> 05:21.570
Earth Needle!

05:25.240 --> 05:27.610
That's a troublesome one.

05:27.620 --> 05:29.870
So that's the cause of
the forest's abnormality.

05:29.870 --> 05:32.370
Wounded members, get back!
You'll get in the way!

05:32.830 --> 05:35.190
Issac, take care of the wounded!

05:35.200 --> 05:36.210
Yes, Sir!

05:36.780 --> 05:39.780
Alan, Elena, that one is too dangerous.

05:39.780 --> 05:41.130
Don't get close to it.

05:41.710 --> 05:44.760
Iris, Gilm, back us up!

05:44.760 --> 05:45.870
- Yes, Sir!
- Yes!

05:45.870 --> 05:47.960
Zach, keep your wits about you!

05:47.960 --> 05:48.720
Yes, Sir!

05:53.040 --> 05:55.060
Damn, it's not working.

05:55.060 --> 06:00.690
Evil Viper's skin is strong against
physical and magical attacks.

06:03.020 --> 06:04.690
Everyone, evade!

06:09.320 --> 06:12.330
We may be crushed
if we get hit by that attack!

06:18.240 --> 06:20.180
Crap, it's after the wounded!

06:20.180 --> 06:21.310
Issac!

06:22.670 --> 06:24.210
Wind Cutter!

06:32.770 --> 06:34.430
Damn it, it's no use.

06:34.890 --> 06:36.360
Hurry, get away further!

06:36.360 --> 06:38.520
T-Thank you!

06:38.520 --> 06:41.480
O' Light, streak through! Light Arrow!

06:41.980 --> 06:45.070
O' Flame, engulf it! Fire Ball!

06:53.830 --> 06:56.540
Nothing is working.
What is its weakness?

06:59.210 --> 07:00.420
Here it comes!

07:02.670 --> 07:04.630
What?! Alan! Elena!

07:04.630 --> 07:06.210
It's dangerous, let it go!

07:11.970 --> 07:14.760
It's now focusing on them!

07:15.310 --> 07:16.430
Inventory!

07:24.860 --> 07:26.940
- I did it!
- Great job, Takumi!

07:28.770 --> 07:30.900
I feel that unsettling gaze again!

07:32.150 --> 07:33.490
Don't get distracted!

07:36.620 --> 07:38.500
Alan! Elena!

07:39.740 --> 07:43.550
Damn it. If I go to them now,
this thing will too.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.710
Are they all right?

07:46.270 --> 07:48.960
Are you all right?
I'll heal you right away!

07:48.960 --> 07:51.200
Takumi, don't worry.

07:51.200 --> 07:53.600
The kids are up already.

07:53.610 --> 07:55.770
Yes, I know...

07:55.780 --> 07:59.370
Rudolf, could you buy me
some time?

07:59.370 --> 08:00.930
What are you going to do?

08:01.690 --> 08:04.420
I'll do an advanced Wind Magic.

08:04.420 --> 08:05.650
Can you do that?

08:05.650 --> 08:08.570
I have never used it, but...

08:09.680 --> 08:12.110
I think I can definitely do it now.

08:12.610 --> 08:15.070
Understood. Leave the rest to us.

08:15.070 --> 08:18.970
Once I give the command,
please retreat far behind me if you can.

08:18.970 --> 08:19.910
Got it!

08:34.380 --> 08:37.380
How much magic will it need?

08:38.750 --> 08:40.810
This much will be enough.

08:40.810 --> 08:41.640
Rudolf!

08:41.640 --> 08:44.020
Retreat! Go behind Takumi!

08:45.900 --> 08:48.820
O' Wind, cut away my enemies.

08:50.780 --> 08:52.440
Wind Edge!

09:04.800 --> 09:07.040
Take this!

09:25.400 --> 09:27.650
Did I beat it?

09:31.440 --> 09:34.400
Oh no! Get away from the trees!

09:46.920 --> 09:48.880
I put in too much magic...

09:48.880 --> 09:52.250
What kind of crazy magic did you do?

09:54.010 --> 09:56.350
Anyway, you saved us.

09:56.350 --> 09:59.970
Takumi, Evil Viper's blood is
a valuable material.

10:00.550 --> 10:02.780
Gather as much as you can
before it all spilled.

10:02.790 --> 10:03.980
O-Okay!

10:03.980 --> 10:05.640
There are also fallen trees.

10:06.430 --> 10:08.100
- Big Brother!
- Big Brother!

10:08.110 --> 10:10.290
- You're amazing!
- You're amazing!

10:10.290 --> 10:11.370
Thank you.

10:11.380 --> 10:14.580
More importantly,
how are your wounds?

10:14.580 --> 10:15.900
That hurt, right?

10:15.900 --> 10:17.610
- We're all right!
- We're all right!

10:18.650 --> 10:19.700
I see.

10:22.750 --> 10:25.150
Miss Iris, thank you very much.

10:25.150 --> 10:27.810
Their injuries are just scratches.

10:27.820 --> 10:30.290
I'm perplexed those are
their only injuries.

10:30.290 --> 10:35.750
Bruises may hurt after a while,
so please be very careful for a while.

10:35.750 --> 10:36.510
Okay.

10:36.510 --> 10:40.470
So their bodies are really sturdy.

10:40.470 --> 10:45.810
A normal human child would be
badly injured or even die.

10:46.220 --> 10:49.100
I have to make sure this
will never happen again.

10:50.100 --> 10:51.270
This gaze...

10:52.450 --> 10:55.850
Seriously, you really pulled
a crazy feat there!

10:55.860 --> 10:58.780
That was seriously an unbelievable magic.

11:09.140 --> 11:10.220
Don't move.

11:12.970 --> 11:14.010
Don't move.

11:15.880 --> 11:18.010
Takumi! What are you doing?!

11:18.370 --> 11:20.970
What am I doing?

11:21.550 --> 11:23.410
Say that to this guy.

11:24.300 --> 11:26.640
What? Ask Sagesse?

11:26.640 --> 11:28.140
Did you do anything?

11:28.620 --> 11:30.560
I didn't do anything!

11:30.560 --> 11:31.950
Nice lie.

11:31.950 --> 11:34.870
You sent such a strong killing intent

11:34.880 --> 11:37.060
and dare to say
you didn't do anything?

11:37.060 --> 11:38.150
What did you say?!

11:38.610 --> 11:42.910
You have been glaring at Takumi
since we grouped up.

11:43.910 --> 11:48.910
He was risking his life,
yet you sent such killing intent.

11:49.540 --> 11:52.170
Moreover, the kids are also injured.

11:52.170 --> 11:53.880
Of course, he is mad.

11:53.880 --> 11:58.100
So the kids turned around
back then because of him?

11:58.100 --> 12:01.590
The killing intention got stronger,
so they turned around in reflex.

12:02.470 --> 12:04.340
Sagesse, you...

12:04.340 --> 12:07.010
You liar!
How dare you spout such a lie!

12:07.460 --> 12:10.410
We almost lost our lives here!

12:10.410 --> 12:11.480
You shut up!

12:12.130 --> 12:14.500
Rudolf also felt that too!

12:14.500 --> 12:16.440
You...

12:16.440 --> 12:18.470
This is all your fault!

12:18.470 --> 12:22.610
How could a commoner like you
steal Captain Lowain's eyes?!

12:22.610 --> 12:26.990
What? Captain Lowain?
Sir Vault?

12:28.410 --> 12:31.730
His name is Sagesse Clantz.
How to say it...

12:32.130 --> 12:35.410
He's been saying he loves the captain.

12:35.420 --> 12:37.090
L-Love?

12:38.340 --> 12:40.920
Is it like respect or adoration or...

12:40.920 --> 12:43.550
No, it appears he romantically loves him.

12:43.550 --> 12:47.310
T-Then, this guy is going at me

12:47.310 --> 12:51.190
because of his relationship
with Sir Vault?

12:51.190 --> 12:52.020
Yeah, kinda...

12:52.020 --> 12:52.930
You got it wrong!

12:52.930 --> 12:54.440
I like girls!

12:54.440 --> 12:57.240
But there is no girl you like
right now, correct?

12:57.240 --> 12:58.770
Well, there is none.

12:58.770 --> 13:00.360
- Then that means!
- That means nothing!

13:00.360 --> 13:04.610
So it's due to your affair, Sir Vault.

13:04.610 --> 13:06.440
I said you got it wrong!

13:06.450 --> 13:09.530
Takumi, let's stop teasing him.

13:09.530 --> 13:11.080
Yeah, right.

13:12.560 --> 13:17.290
I'm very sorry that you got involved
in the knights' personal affairs.

13:17.810 --> 13:20.220
It is our lack of supervision.

13:20.220 --> 13:23.070
Would you mind if you left
the punishment to us?

13:23.070 --> 13:24.260
Sure.

13:24.260 --> 13:27.970
Are you sure?
The kids were injured, too.

13:27.970 --> 13:29.680
- We're okay!
- We're okay!

13:29.680 --> 13:32.200
Thankfully, they were only lightly injured

13:32.200 --> 13:35.480
and I'm also responsible
for ignoring the killing intention.

13:35.480 --> 13:41.150
But I won't forgive you a second time,
so please keep that in mind.

13:42.660 --> 13:44.110
We're in your debt.

13:44.110 --> 13:46.130
You're done with the talk?

13:46.130 --> 13:48.380
Takumi, I want to eat good food.

13:48.380 --> 13:51.090
My stomach got empty after
fighting the big monster.

13:51.090 --> 13:52.830
You're right, we're famished!

13:52.830 --> 13:57.790
- Man, we're famished, really!
- You're right! I want to eat something!

13:57.790 --> 14:01.000
The other knights are innocents, but...

14:02.530 --> 14:05.260
To be honest,
I don't feel good about them.

14:05.260 --> 14:07.390
I want to eat with everyone!

14:07.390 --> 14:09.470
I want to eat with the knights!

14:10.460 --> 14:13.640
You two were in danger
because of them...

14:13.640 --> 14:15.350
- We can't?
- We can't?

14:16.180 --> 14:17.600
No, I didn't say that.

14:19.480 --> 14:21.770
They are such good kids.

14:22.210 --> 14:26.440
All of you must be really hungry.
So let's prepare for a meal.

14:26.810 --> 14:28.200
Would you all help me?

14:28.210 --> 14:29.240
Of course!

14:29.240 --> 14:32.770
Rudolf, please help out
dismembering the orc.

14:32.770 --> 14:34.450
Yeah, leave it to me.

14:36.350 --> 14:37.800
- We'll crack the eggs!
- We'll crack the eggs!

14:37.800 --> 14:38.920
Oh, thank you.

14:42.530 --> 14:44.490
It's all right! It's okay!

14:44.500 --> 14:47.080
You'll quickly get better at it.

14:47.090 --> 14:48.090
I mean, look at her.

14:51.050 --> 14:52.470
- We're the same!
- We're the same!

14:52.470 --> 14:54.510
I can actually do better, trust me!

14:59.660 --> 15:00.010
(Name: Takumi Kayano. Job: Magician, Level: 25)

15:00.010 --> 15:02.300
(Name: Takumi Kayano. Job: Magician, Level: 25)
I leveled up quite a lot.

15:02.300 --> 15:05.220
(Name: Takumi Kayano. Job: Magician, Level: 25)
The summon category is added too.

15:05.870 --> 15:06.630
(Name: Takumi Kayano. Job: Magician, Level: 25)
Huh?

15:07.070 --> 15:11.030
Water Magic? Did Syl add that?

15:11.030 --> 15:12.540
Let's try using that next time.

15:12.540 --> 15:13.740
Takumi.

15:14.200 --> 15:15.640
Sir Vault.

15:15.640 --> 15:17.700
I am really sorry for today.

15:17.700 --> 15:19.680
Don't sweat it.

15:19.680 --> 15:21.750
The kids are all right too.

15:21.750 --> 15:22.920
- Want to sit?
- Want to sit?

15:23.380 --> 15:24.550
Can I?

15:24.550 --> 15:25.630
- Sure!
- Sure!

15:25.630 --> 15:28.550
You both are really good kids!

15:28.550 --> 15:29.590
I know, right?

15:31.060 --> 15:33.740
We're really indebted to you guys.

15:33.740 --> 15:35.860
I'm ending this expedition here.

15:37.320 --> 15:38.510
- Huh?
- Huh?

15:38.520 --> 15:42.270
We have many injured, so anything
more than this is dangerous.

15:42.810 --> 15:45.360
- We'll leave the forest the next morning.
- I see.

15:45.900 --> 15:49.240
Which means, your quest
is completed as well.

15:49.240 --> 15:52.240
Once we're back, please take
the reward from the guild.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.450
Okay.

15:53.450 --> 15:56.980
He said our job is done.
Thank you, you two!

15:56.980 --> 15:58.490
- It was fun!
- It was fun!

15:58.490 --> 16:00.660
Then I guess I'll ask you again.

16:00.660 --> 16:01.660
- Of course!
- Of course!

16:01.660 --> 16:04.890
What? I personally want
some breaks, though.

16:08.180 --> 16:09.630
Mr. Takumi!

16:10.510 --> 16:11.730
Welcome back!

16:11.740 --> 16:13.470
I-I'm back, Miss Luna.

16:13.470 --> 16:15.430
I was waiting for you!

16:15.430 --> 16:18.050
Now, let's go! Hurry up!

16:19.730 --> 16:21.480
- B-Big Bro?
- B-Big Bro?

16:21.480 --> 16:23.270
Both of you, follow us too!

16:25.350 --> 16:27.060
So you are Sir Takumi.

16:27.610 --> 16:32.030
I'm Johan, the Shireen
adventurer guild master.

16:32.030 --> 16:36.240
I'm very pleased to meet you.
I'm Takumi Kayano.

16:36.240 --> 16:38.950
These kids are Alan and Elena.

16:38.950 --> 16:40.040
I see.

16:40.040 --> 16:43.500
Anyway, Sir Lowain and
Sir Rudolf have told me that

16:43.500 --> 16:46.920
it will be bad to leave you
at your current rank.

16:47.370 --> 16:52.090
Right, they said they'll  recommend me
after defeating the orcs...

16:53.910 --> 16:57.130
You may have considerable power.

16:58.840 --> 17:02.680
Forgive me, but you don't
look that strong to me.

17:06.250 --> 17:10.760
That said, you were recommended
by two people with dependable skills.

17:11.030 --> 17:13.490
I think of making you an A rank.

17:13.490 --> 17:16.160
A rank?! In such a short time?!

17:16.160 --> 17:18.780
It's amazing! What a great achievement!

17:18.780 --> 17:20.790
Luna, calm down.

17:22.160 --> 17:25.960
Oh my, forgive me.
I got a bit too excited.

17:26.330 --> 17:29.460
Your skill is guaranteed by two people.

17:29.460 --> 17:34.260
After all, you have beaten a Bloody Wolf
and an Evil Viper, right?

17:34.260 --> 17:36.430
And by that, I turn into an A rank?

17:37.270 --> 17:41.090
Sorry, but I can't give you an S rank.

17:41.510 --> 17:44.890
No, no, it's not like I'm disappointed.

17:44.890 --> 17:48.850
On the contrary, I didn't think
I would get to be an A rank.

17:48.850 --> 17:50.820
No problem about it.

17:50.820 --> 17:55.780
Moreover, I heard that
these kids are also strong.

17:55.780 --> 17:58.780
- What will you do?
- What will... I do?

17:58.780 --> 18:02.120
Changing the kids into high rankers
may cause others to bear ill will.

18:02.480 --> 18:04.700
And yet if we let them stay in E rank,

18:04.700 --> 18:07.210
you won't be able to take
the high-ranking quests.

18:07.650 --> 18:11.920
I see, a party rank is determined
by the average rank of the members.

18:12.500 --> 18:17.380
So he said it's a waste for an A rank
to take low-rank quests.

18:18.400 --> 18:19.780
What do you two want?

18:19.780 --> 18:20.930
- What?
- What?

18:20.930 --> 18:22.100
Sure you don't know.

18:22.810 --> 18:28.100
Then, what about raising
their rank one level to D rank?

18:28.100 --> 18:31.310
I see, then your party rank will be C...

18:31.730 --> 18:34.230
You can also take the B rank quest.

18:34.230 --> 18:36.190
That'll help us loads as well.

18:36.200 --> 18:38.320
Then, please.

18:38.320 --> 18:41.040
- Luna, please take care of the paperwork.
- Yes, Sir!

18:43.420 --> 18:45.910
Rummage..

18:46.510 --> 18:47.370
- Here!
- Here!

18:48.460 --> 18:49.700
Thank you, kids.

18:50.620 --> 18:52.270
Umm... Huh?

18:52.280 --> 18:53.750
Wait! Mr. Takumi!

18:53.760 --> 18:54.750
Yes?

18:54.750 --> 18:58.130
Did you finish exploring
the Earth Labyrinth?

18:58.130 --> 19:02.120
Ah, I forgot that the card records it.

19:02.120 --> 19:04.600
Yeah, that's right.

19:04.600 --> 19:09.040
You went to the labyrinth just once
before the expedition, right?

19:09.050 --> 19:11.690
Did you finish exploring
in those few days?

19:12.770 --> 19:14.500
Well, that's right.

19:14.500 --> 19:17.570
No, wait a minute!
That's a record speed!

19:17.570 --> 19:18.610
Huh?

19:18.610 --> 19:22.660
Well, it is thanks to the kids
that we didn't get lost...

19:22.660 --> 19:26.120
Miss Luna, could you keep
secret about this?

19:26.120 --> 19:29.710
Why? Normally people would
want to brag about it.

19:29.710 --> 19:35.590
I want to avoid situations that may endanger
Alan and Elena if we get even more attention.

19:35.590 --> 19:36.550
Oh...

19:37.410 --> 19:42.290
I think no one would pick a fight against
the person who defeated Evil Viper,

19:42.290 --> 19:44.510
but idiots are everywhere, right?

19:45.000 --> 19:46.130
Gotcha.

19:47.670 --> 19:50.500
Here, the rank-up administration is done.

19:50.510 --> 19:52.560
Here are the expedition rewards.

19:52.560 --> 19:54.020
- Money!
- Money!

19:54.020 --> 19:55.790
Thank you very much.

19:56.120 --> 19:57.980
Now, let's go home, kids.

19:57.980 --> 19:59.860
Hey, Mr. Takumi!

19:59.860 --> 20:01.900
What is it...?

20:01.900 --> 20:05.120
Why so puzzled, of course,
it's the materials!

20:05.120 --> 20:07.280
Evil Viper! Bloody Wolf!

20:07.280 --> 20:12.460
I heard from Mr. Rudolf there are many
other materials from the Forest of Gaia!

20:13.570 --> 20:17.160
There is also the labyrinth!
You'll sell them, right?

20:17.160 --> 20:19.330
Here is the material lover...

20:19.330 --> 20:20.920
I can't do it here...

20:20.920 --> 20:25.180
Don't worry! I have secured
a large warehouse just for you!

20:25.180 --> 20:26.590
I'll take you there now!

20:27.390 --> 20:30.220
- Big Brother.
- Where are you going?

20:30.220 --> 20:33.230
A place where we can show the big snake.

20:33.230 --> 20:35.400
- Are you tired?
- We're fine!

20:35.400 --> 20:39.440
I see. It will be done soon
so please wait a bit.

20:39.820 --> 20:41.900
- Okay, we got it!
- Okay, we got it!

20:45.190 --> 20:49.450
I want to leave some of the
Evil Viper materials for ourselves...

20:50.540 --> 20:54.330
But not everything, right?
You'll sell some, right?

20:54.330 --> 20:57.880
Of course.
Rather, how much does the guild want?

20:57.880 --> 21:02.420
Let's see... Half or if you could,
two-thirds of it all.

21:02.420 --> 21:07.890
Then, we'll take one-third of the meat
and skin and give the rest to the guild.

21:07.890 --> 21:09.100
Are you sure?

21:09.100 --> 21:14.230
If we have enough for defense items
and meals for three, it's okay for me.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.700
Thank you!

21:15.700 --> 21:17.410
I also want to exchange these.

21:21.690 --> 21:24.690
T-There are so many materials
from the Forest of Gaia!

21:26.060 --> 21:27.950
It's all right, calm down.

21:27.950 --> 21:31.120
Mr. Takumi! Can I buy all of them?!

21:31.120 --> 21:33.160
We don't accept cancellations, you know!

21:33.160 --> 21:34.620
Y-Yeah, sure...

21:34.620 --> 21:36.080
Thank you!

21:36.080 --> 21:39.040
Thank you to you too, Alan and Elena!

21:42.900 --> 21:44.970
I feel strangely exhausted.

21:44.970 --> 21:46.750
Alan feels great!

21:46.750 --> 21:48.010
Elena too!

21:49.180 --> 21:52.230
Can we hurry back to the lodging
and lounge around?

21:52.230 --> 21:54.440
- Lounge!
- Around!

21:55.920 --> 21:58.150
Due to the exhaustion after
the Forest of Gaia,

22:00.670 --> 22:03.300
I fell asleep straight away.

22:04.960 --> 22:07.420
- Good night, Big Brother.
- Good night, Big Brother.

22:28.590 --> 22:32.810
♪Forever, all the time♪

22:32.810 --> 22:35.720
♪I just can't keep crying♪

22:35.720 --> 22:36.640
♪Ah! Ah!♪

22:36.640 --> 22:40.270
♪In happy moments and sad moments♪

22:40.270 --> 22:43.400
♪If I am with you♪

22:45.280 --> 22:47.320
♪Such a good weather♪

22:47.320 --> 22:50.910
♪Today, let's go slowly♪

22:50.910 --> 22:53.030
♪While taking detours♪

22:53.030 --> 22:57.910
♪The clear sky,
the wind caressing my cheeks♪

22:57.910 --> 23:01.170
♪And your gentle gaze♪

23:01.170 --> 23:04.090
♪Beyond an unknown road♪

23:04.090 --> 23:06.260
♪The wind blows past♪

23:06.260 --> 23:09.260
♪The curtain of light sways♪

23:10.010 --> 23:13.640
♪Maybe we should try going
I just feel like it♪

23:13.640 --> 23:20.020
♪No matter what happens
we can laugh anyway♪

23:22.230 --> 23:26.360
♪Forever, all the time♪

23:26.480 --> 23:29.240
♪I just can't keep crying♪

23:29.240 --> 23:30.490
♪Ah! Ah!♪

23:30.490 --> 23:33.990
♪In happy moments and sad moments♪

23:33.990 --> 23:37.290
♪If I am with you♪

23:38.450 --> 23:43.250
♪I am sure I'll be content♪

23:44.900 --> 23:45.860
(Next Episode)

23:45.920 --> 23:48.500
- Goblin!
- Defeat them!

23:48.500 --> 23:49.900
(Next Episode)
(Goblin, Defeat Them!)
